 steps=["I locate the reset and preceding valuable commit in reflog.","I inspect the candidate before creating a rescue branch.","I confirm the valuable file is reachable again without moving main."],
 why="The old commit still exists locally and the reflog helps locate it. A rescue reference protects it before further operations.",
